{
  "id": "1CH.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Damanyoojiga 10",
  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda sugoocheanda siguura Sawli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gang'uchi fuga Filisti sea Israeli; ak gamng'awa fuga Israeli aba madeeda fuga Filisti, ak geabwar aba madeeda giijeeda Gilbowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean fuga Filisti ghwaat geeshta Sawli ea orjoagaaschi ak ghabwar fuga Filisti Yonatan ea Abinadabu ea Malkishuwa, was orjeeda Sawli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'waaniit ng'ucheeda muuchi aba badayda Sawli, ak gafu fuga ghuweanga niny; ak gwasawan fuga ghuweanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Sawli siidaanyi eada dabitaanyi bea ng'ucheeda, “Fakni ng'utaang'u, ak gung'udanaan, adiidu ghwahidu fiisu meeyiilean ak gwajukean.” Hean ghaheawa siidaanyi eada dabitaanyi bea ng'ucheeda; aba gideaba ghoawal muuchi. Ng'ata gageanu Sawli ng'utaanyi, ak goong'adeasa geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah siida eada dabita ng'ucheeda gideaba nimi Sawli, eara niny goong'adeasa geaw ng'utaanyi, ak ghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ea nimi Sawli; niny sea orjoagaaschi asamwagu ak goosha eara fugeaba gheanyi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah buuneesean bea Israeli mida moangoachi gideaba nimng'aw lugooda nea Sawli ea orjoagaaschi ea nimeewa, gwanung'usa heeda mujiinajeega nyaawa ak gamng'aw; ak ghapka fuga Filisti ak ghamway. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwahidu fuga Filisti ghang'aw fuga sibwar, ghwanyasa Sawli ea orjoagaaschi nea niibeedeaysa uhuuda giijeeda Gilbowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geang'aw niny ak gealach gheata ak geegeanda uhuudaanyi ea dabitaanyi bea ng'ucheeda, ak geecheakta buuneeda gaweay jeeda ng'eanyiisean bea Filisti, gweasa iita miy haleanjeeda nyaawa was sanaamajeega nyaawa ea heeda buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwayiin dabitaanyi bea ng'ucheeda jeeda gheeda aseecheeka nyaawa, ak gwarasa uhuudaanyi jeeda gheeda sibata aseeta Dagoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwayiiy buuneesean mida Yabesh-gileyadi ng'asheega sean sima Sawli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghang'eatng'eat buuneesean meanyi, ak gageanda musta Sawli ea muscheeka orjoagaaschi, ak gweadu Yabeshi. Ak gabung'sa geaka nyaawa guumda sawacheanda aba Yabeshi, ak gooluulda geat eawooji ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghami Sawli aba nyoota mureeda; aba gideaba masisiina mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba gideaba mwaang'waanya ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea goobalool meanga, nea gagasa weeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea magasa ghuhooda aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Hean ghabwar NG'UTAMIIDA niny, ak ghwayam gheambalmeeda ghoadaw Dawdi orjeeda Yese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
